      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828447600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14882,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828452200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Do you have the order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828454200000
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. It's VF88602.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14882,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828458866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see an order for a pair of VeloPro cycling shoes, delivered about 73 days ago. Is that correct?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828460266666
    },
    {
      "text": "If you say so. I just know I need to send them back.",
