      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14882,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828470399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. Can I ask what the issue is with the cycling shoes?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828474066665
    },
    {
      "text": "They give me blisters. They're just not comfortable.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 14882,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828478266665
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that. I know how important a good fit is. Did you have any trouble with setting up the cleats, or was the problem solely with the fit of the shoe itself?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 304,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765828481933331
